+# ----------------------------------------------------------
+# ENGINEERING RUNTIME ACCESS TOKEN
+#
+# The engineering API (/api/engineer/*, /api/browser/capture) reads
+# source, runs whitelisted commands, spawns preview servers and drives
+# a headless browser. It is FAIL CLOSED:
+#
+#   LELU_ENGINEER_TOKEN unset  → every one of those routes answers 503.
+#                                This is the correct production state.
+#   LELU_ENGINEER_TOKEN set    → every route requires `x-lelu-token`.
+#
+# On a public host, leave BOTH lines below empty. To self-develop on a
+# machine you trust, set both to the same value — the VITE_ one is
+# baked into the client build, the plain one is read at run time.
+# There is no loopback exemption, so a reverse proxy cannot let anyone
+# in by accident.
+# ----------------------------------------------------------
+LELU_ENGINEER_TOKEN=
+VITE_LELU_ENGINEER_TOKEN=
+
 # ----------------------------------------------------------
 # SECURITY NOTES
 #
